{"id":35350,"date":"2024-11-19T09:45:55","date_gmt":"2024-11-19T02:45:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/?page_id=35350"},"modified":"2024-11-19T09:49:07","modified_gmt":"2024-11-19T02:49:07","slug":"theme-v-student-code-of-conduct","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/theme-v-student-code-of-conduct\/","title":{"rendered":"Theme V: Student Code of Conduct \u200b"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"35350\" class=\"elementor elementor-35350\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-052611b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"052611b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b04ebf7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b04ebf7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d1f71b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6d1f71b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75219b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"75219b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fdb413c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fdb413c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Theme V: Student Code of Conduct \u200b<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0acabb0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"0acabb0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1ff9a4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d1ff9a4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li><strong>General prohibition<\/strong><\/li><\/ol><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Assaulting, harassing, intimidating, or threatening another individual or group<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Endangering the health or safety of others<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stealing, misusing, destroying, defacing or damaging University property or property belonging to someone else<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Disrupting University activities<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Using University facilities, equipment, services or computers without authorization<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Making false accusations against any member of the University<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Supplying false information to the University or forging, altering or misusing any University document or record.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Storing, possessing or using real or replica firearms or other weapons, explosives (including fireworks), ammunition, or toxic or otherwise dangerous materials on university premises<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Using, possessing or distributing illegal drugs<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Violating provincial liquor laws or University alcohol policies<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Encouraging, aiding, or conspiring in any prohibited conduct<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Failing to comply with a disciplinary measure or disciplinary measures imposed under the procedures of this Code.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0 \u00a02. <strong>Academic Dishonesty<\/strong><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cheating<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Copying another\u2019s work, allowing other students to plagiarize one\u2019s own work, Stealing or improperly obtaining tests<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Plagiarism\u00a0<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Using ideas and\/or wording from an external source, intentionally or unintentionally, without proper attribution<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fabrication\u00a0<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Intentionally falsifying or inventing ideas and information on an academic exercise, minor or major, without authorization<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0 \u00a03. <strong>Disciplinary measures to be imposed under the Code of Conduct<\/strong><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Written warning or reprimand<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Probation, during which certain conditions must be fulfilled and good behaviour must be demonstrated<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Payment of costs or compensation for any loss, damage or injury caused by the conduct<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Issuance of an apology, made publicly or privately<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Loss of certain privileges including restriction or prohibition of access to, or use of, university facilities, services, activities or programs<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fines or loss of fees<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Relocation or exclusion from residence<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Suspension or expulsion<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8da1c7a elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"8da1c7a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa0b41f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fa0b41f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Theme V: Student Code of Conduct \u200b General prohibition Assaulting, harassing, intimidating, or threatening another individual or group Endangering the health or safety of others Stealing, misusing, destroying, defacing or damaging University property or property belonging to someone else Disrupting University activities Using University facilities, equipment, services or computers without authorization Making false accusations against any member of the University Supplying false information to the University or forging, altering or misusing any University document or record. Storing, possessing or using real or replica firearms or other weapons, explosives (including fireworks), ammunition, or toxic or otherwise dangerous materials on university premises Using, possessing or distributing illegal drugs Violating provincial liquor laws or University alcohol policies Encouraging, aiding, or conspiring in any prohibited conduct Failing to comply with a disciplinary measure or disciplinary measures imposed under the procedures of this Code. \u00a0 \u00a02. Academic Dishonesty Cheating Copying another\u2019s work, allowing other students to plagiarize one\u2019s own work, Stealing or improperly obtaining tests Plagiarism\u00a0 Using ideas and\/or wording from an external source, intentionally or unintentionally, without proper attribution Fabrication\u00a0 Intentionally falsifying or inventing ideas and information on an academic exercise, minor or major, without authorization \u00a0 \u00a03. Disciplinary measures to be imposed under the Code of Conduct Written warning or reprimand Probation, during which certain conditions must be fulfilled and good behaviour must be demonstrated Payment of costs or compensation for any loss, damage or injury caused by the conduct Issuance of an apology, made publicly or privately Loss of certain privileges including restriction or prohibition of access to, or use of, university facilities, services, activities or programs Fines or loss of fees Relocation or exclusion from residence Suspension or expulsion<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":7,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-35350","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","post-no-thumbnail"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/35350","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/7"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=35350"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/35350\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":35354,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/35350\/revisions\/35354"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=35350"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}